Subject: [PATCH] rometadata: ECMA-335 metadata reader
 (IMetaDataImport/Import2/AssemblyImport)

- IMetaDataDispenser::OpenScope and OpenScopeOnMemory open PE (.winmd/.dll) images or raw
  metadata and return IMetaDataImport, IMetaDataImport2 and IMetaDataAssemblyImport
- tables, #Strings/#US/#GUID/#Blob heaps, coded indexes, enumerations (types, methods, fields,
  params, interface impls, member refs, custom attributes, properties, events, generics, ...),
  Find*, Get*Props, constants, class layout, pinvoke maps, custom attribute by name, PE kind
- include/cor.idl declares the three interfaces (vtable order checked against mingw-w64 cor.h)
- tests: hand-built metadata image; SG_METADATA_FILE runs a real file

