+ * ECMA-335 metadata reader: IMetaDataImport, IMetaDataImport2 and
+ * IMetaDataAssemblyImport over .NET assemblies and .winmd files.
+ *
+ * Written from the published ECMA-335 standard (partition II, metadata
+ * physical layout) and the documented behaviour of the metadata APIs.
